          "text": "ቤተ ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ነግሦላቸው ፡ ደስ ፡ ብሏ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸዋልና ፡ (ወዘይጼዐኖ) ፡ በዘመኑ ፡ ትእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምርተ ፡ ኀይል ፡ ትእምርተ ፡ መዊዕ ፡ አ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ለው ፡ (ወወሀብዎ) ፡ አይሁድ ፡ ያከብሩ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታል ። (ወወፅአ) ፡ ምእመናንን ፡ ድል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሊነሣ ፡ ወጣ ፡ ወሞዐ ፡ ድል ፡ ነሣ ። አን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ድም ፡ (ፈረስ ፡ ጸዐዳ) ፡ ዘመነ ፡ ሐሳዌ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መሢሕ፡ ነው፡ ጸዐዳ፡ አለው፡ ምእመናን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዘመኑ፡ መከራ፡ ተቀብለው፡ ዋጋቸውን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አግኝተው ፡ ደስ ፡ ብሏቸዋልና ፡ (ወዘይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጼዐኖ፡) በዘመኑ ፡ ያሉ፡ ምእመናን፡ ትእም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርተ ፡ ኀይል ፡ ትእምርተ ፡ መዊዕ ፡ አላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቸው ፡ (ወወሀብዎ) ፡ ክብራቸውን ፡ መና",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገር ፡ ነው ፡ (ወወፅአ) ፡ ድል ፡ ሊነሡ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወጡ ፡ (ወሞዐ) ፡ ድል ፡ ነሡ ፡ በሰማዕ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትነት ፡ መሞታቸውን ፡ ድል ፡ መንሣት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ብሎት ፡ በመዠመሪያው ፡ መንፈቅ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነው ። አንድም ፡ (ፈረስ ፡ ጸዐዳ) ፡ ሠረ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገላ ፡ ፀሐይ ፡ ነው ፡ ጸዐዳ ፡ አለው ፡ ብሩህ፡",
